NOTE ON DATA AND CLINICAL USE

This license covers source code only.

Input data are public-domain U.S. federal government works and are not
redistributed here:
  - NSDUH public use files (SAMHSA/CBHSQ)
  - FAERS quarterly ASCII extracts (U.S. FDA)
Users must obtain these from the agencies directly and follow the terms
attached to each source.

The software is a research artifact. It is NOT a medical device, has not been
reviewed or cleared by any regulatory authority, and must not be used to
direct patient care. It surfaces evidence; it does not give clinical advice.
